Third-party notices
===================

TT-Toolbox
----------

tensorlib/laplacian_mpo.py is a Python port of exp/tt_qlaplace_dd.m from
TT-Toolbox. The port changes the implementation language and tensor-axis
layout, but retains the construction given by the reference implementation.

Project: https://github.com/oseledets/TT-Toolbox
Source revision: 40d0d9dbef4195155be52730d4f30ca2ecf7b74e
Reference file:
https://github.com/oseledets/TT-Toolbox/blob/40d0d9dbef4195155be52730d4f30ca2ecf7b74e/exp/tt_qlaplace_dd.m
License: MIT

