tensor4all-rs
-------------

The carry-based construction in tensorlib/shift.py is derived from the shift
operator in the tensor4all-quanticstransform crate. The Python implementation
uses least-significant-bit-first ordering and contracts the operator directly
into the MPS cores instead of returning a separate MPO.

Project: https://github.com/tensor4all/tensor4all-rs
Source revision: fd61f082c7d2234db2e7b88e73e5fd1f5a0c4228
Reference file:
https://github.com/tensor4all/tensor4all-rs/blob/fd61f082c7d2234db2e7b88e73e5fd1f5a0c4228/crates/tensor4all-quanticstransform/src/shift.rs
License: MIT
Upstream lineage: the tensor4all-quanticstransform crate identifies itself as
a port of Quantics.jl (https://github.com/tensor4all/Quantics.jl), validated
against version 0.4.7.

The tensor4all-rs copyright and license notice follows verbatim:

